## Summary

Implemented the native SwiftUI **BackupRestorePage** (P4-Apple · P7) at full web parity, adaptive across macOS + iOS, committed as `1579ea731`.

**Parity: 91/91** — 6 panels (Total-Configs / Total-Backups / Last-Backup / Total-Size + Configurations + History), 4 data states (loading / empty / error / success), 81 i18n strings.

**What shipped** (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/`, 10 sources + 16 tests):
- `@MainActor @Observable BackupRestorePageModel` bound through an injectable `BackupRestoreProviding` seam (P1/S8) — no I/O in the view; `view.opened` telemetry (P1/S11). The manifest declares **no API data sources** (verified: the shared KMP core has no backup-configs/runs repo), so the page renders from local state via a real, functional in-memory provider.
- Stats grid, configs/history `TSDataTable`s, create/edit form (dynamic per-provider fields), delete-confirm alert, restore-preview (checksum + metadata + tables/noTables) — all from P2 tokens + P3 shared `TS*` components only.
- Registered on a new `.backup` route via the P4 shell `RouteHostRegistry`; 81 strings + `route.backup` added to `Localizable.xcstrings` (web key names verbatim); `project.yml`/`.swiftlint.yml` wired for the new `Features/` dir.

**Verification (green):** swiftformat (0/11), swiftlint scoped (0 violations), placeholder gate (COUNT=0), isolated Swift-6 strict-concurrency build + **16/16 tests** against the real component library, and iOS-18 / macOS-15 SDK typechecks. The `Shared.xcframework` was assembled (Gradle, exit 0).

**Honest disposition:** the full-app `xcodebuild` is **DEFERRED** — it fails on **one pre-existing, unrelated** `@ViewBuilder` error in `shared-surfaces/AIGeofenceAwareAutomationSuggestions.swift` (proven in committed `HEAD` 40e1e5da0, untouched by me) and macOS dev-signing; **zero Features/Admin errors** in the full-app build. A first-draft name collision with `BackupMonitorWidget` (`BackupRun`/`BackupRunStatus`/`BackupStatusChip`) was my regression and was fixed by namespacing to `BackupRestore*`. Log at `.github/prompts/monorepo/logs/apple-page-admin-BackupRestorePage.log` (`EXIT=0` / `STATUS=DONE`); ledger rows added for `apple-macos` + `apple-ios`.



